d_ts": "2026-11-27T02:00:00Z", "web_checkout_typeerrors_v5_8": 7168}, "refutes": ["capacity_limit"], "supports": ["release"]}, {"claim": "iOS is clearly unaffected and android is affected. But the data does not support blaming the android app release v9.14, which went to 20% of users at 01:00Z. Android errors carry only the checkout-web tag v5.8, the drop starts at 03:00Z rather than 01:00Z, and web, which has no app release, dropped by the same amount. I could not split android v9.14 users from other android users, because the errors are not broken out by app build.", "confidence": 0.6, "numbers": {"android_rate_equals_web_rate": 0.0625, "android_release_ts": "2026-11-27T01:00:00Z", "android_v9_14_rollout_pct": 20}, "refutes": [], "supports": ["release"]}], "suggested_next": ["Release/Engineering: does rolling back checkout-web v5.8 bring web and android cart_to_checkout_rate back to about 0.5?", "Payments: confirm PSP-2 success rate held despite its latency problem from 02:00Z.", "Commercial: how much of the DE GMV gap comes from lost web and android checkouts versus the expected Black Friday lift?"]}, "name": "submit", "toolset_name": null, "type": "tool_use"}], "context_management": null, "diagnostics": null, "id": "msg_011ChGH7wDyZjqvRHUdtrtRD", "input_transformations": null, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4936, "fallback_credit": null, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2718, "iterations": [{"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4936, "input_tokens": 2718, "model": null, "output_tokens": 1392, "type": "message"}], "output_tokens": 1392, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 140}, "